ded up on a strange and unknown planet, Earth, stripped of your advanced tools and resources. A mysterious alien race, the Jurri, manipulate reality to control the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must uncover the truth behind the Jurri\u2019s influence, conquer their seductive powers, and decide the fate of Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351300/extras/55648d9e4406e1ea4bf8a82d6d2e904d.avif?t=1745616540\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351300/extras/52cc3ce072d8c0c2af6c48ca63d75c0a.poster.avif?t=1745616540\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351300/extras/52cc3ce072d8c0c2af6c48ca63d75c0a.webm?t=1745616540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351300/extras/52cc3ce072d8c0c2af6c48ca63d75c0a.mp4?t=1745616540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is a beautiful world, but don\u2019t let its illusions deceive you\u2014this  is a dangerous and deadly place. The <strong>Jurri</strong> have twisted reality, creating beautiful yet treacherous landscapes. Be ready to fight, survive, and resist their seductive allure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351300/extras/d5bbad26b32cb0f2e4252ab6d32d7062.avif?t=1745616540\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351300/extras/726fc3e387972